T*
(Possible Next Steps) Tj
T*
(===================) Tj
T*
(To improve robustness, we could expand training data to include more informal text and) Tj
T*
(code-switching examples. We could add lightweight confidence scoring and a fallback) Tj
T*
(workflow that routes uncertain predictions to a transformer model or human review.) Tj
T*
(Finally, adding more languages would be straightforward for the n-gram model as long as) Tj
T*
(labeled data is available, making the system scalable for broader multilingual support.) Tj
